          "description": "App icon master (1024x1024 PNG recommended, or an SVG). The favicons and installed-app icons are found next to it as <name>_16x16.png, _32x32, _64x64, _192x192 and _512x512; the 64 px one is the in-app logo. null or omitted: Connect's icon.",
